* {{IPA|de|/ˈmaʊ̯lˌvʊʁf/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Maulwurf.ogg}}
* {{a|de|Austria}} {{audio|de|De-at-Maulwurf.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Maul|wurf}}

